phi-runtime (0.2.0~git202609022114.a77b3c2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The string vocabulary joins the library (6d string sweep):
    header-only phi::str (str.h) and phi::maps (maputil.h) - the
    QString/QHash idioms phi-core and the adapter ports translate onto,
    pinned by str_tests. The transitional phicore::runtime alias is
    removed from every header; consumers say phi::runtime. API addition
    plus source-breaking alias removal, no ABI change: SOVERSION stays 0.

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Wed, 02 Sep 2026 21:14:22 +0200

phi-runtime (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The runtime leaves phi-core (6e-a): loops, loop-owning threads,
    cross-thread posts and bounded queues as libphi-runtime.so.0, one
    dynamic library so a Loop& handed across a plugin boundary means the
    same loop state on every side. Namespace phi::runtime, with a
    transition alias for phicore::runtime until 6d. SONAME deliberately
    unstable: every breaking cut bumps it.

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:40:00 +0200
